"YT","itemVideoId":"9cHUtRQ04bY","itemPopupTitle":"Copilot+ PC"},{"buyconfItemTypeCode":"SC-ADH","itemTitle":"SC+ Damage Text","optionBoxDescription":"\u003cb\u003eScreen Protection: Protection against accidental physical screen damage.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAccidental \u0026 Liquid Damage: Both, Screen \u0026 Damage protection against Accidental or Liquid damage.\u003cbr /\u003eRepairs in authorized Samsung Service Centers only."},{"buyconfItemTypeCode":"SC-EXW","itemTitle":"SC+ Extended Warranty Text","optionBoxDescription":"\u003cb\u003eExtended Warranty: Provided by the Manufacturer against any mechanical or electrical breakdown/defects.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eComprehensive Protection: Screen \u0026 Damage protection against Accidental or Liquid damage, along with Extended Manufacturer\u0027s warranty.\u003cbr /\u003eRepairs in authorized Samsung Service Centers only."},{"buyconfItemTypeCode":"SC-TFT","itemTitle":"SC+ Theft Text","optionBoxDescription":"\u003cb\u003eStolen devices replaced, at home or abroad\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eScreen crack? We’ve got your back.\u003cbr /\u003eFixed by certified Samsung experts with 100% Samsung parts."},{"buyconfItemTypeCode":"SS","itemTitle":"How can I move the data on my iPhone to a Samsung Galaxy phone?","itemDescription":"Smart Switch offers a quick and easy way to transfer the data from your old phone — even if it has a different OS like an iPhone — onto your new Samsung Galaxy.\r\u003cbr /\u003e\r\u003cbr /\u003e*Terms and Conditions apply. Please visit the Smart Switch page for more information.","itemImageUrl":"//images.samsung.com/in/smartphones/galaxy-s26/buy/smart_switch_PC.png","itemMobileImageUrl":"//images.samsung.com/in/smartphones/galaxy-s26/buy/smart_switch_MO.png","itemPopupTypeCode":"NONE"},{"buyconfItemTypeCode":"SVG","itemTitle":"Not sure which storage option to choose?","itemDescription":"Figure out your storage needs in just a couple of steps.","itemImageUrl":"/etc.clientlibs/samsung/clientlibs/consumer/global/clientlib-common/resources/images/IN_Storage_DM-Buying-How-to_Buy-page_Thumbnail.png","itemMobileImageUrl":"/etc.clientlibs/samsung/clientlibs/consumer/global/clientlib-common/resources/images/IN_Storage_DM-Buying-How-to_Buy-page_Thumbnail.png?$ORIGIN_PNG$","itemPopupTypeCode":"TWV","itemVideoTypeCode":"YT","itemVideoId":"-QOs0o7LBms","itemPopupTitle":"How much phone storage is right for you?","itemPopupSubTitle":"How much storage space do you need for your new phone? Finding the right option might be simpler than you think.","itemPopupDescription":"First, get a baseline of your current storage use by checking your device.\r\u003cbr /\u003e\r\u003cbr /\u003eOn your Samsung Galaxy, go to Settings \u003e Battery and Device Care.\r\u003cbr /\u003eOn a non-Samsung Galaxy phone, go to General \u003e Storage.\r\u003cbr /\u003e\r\u003cbr /\u003eHere, you can see how much storage is in use and how much is still free. You\u0027ll also get a breakdown of categories, like saved photos, videos, apps, music and other files.\r\u003cbr /\u003e\r\u003cbr /\u003eNext, think of a typical day on your phone and whether you do a lot of storage-intensive activities.\r\u003cbr /\u003e\r\u003cbr /\u003eIf you don\u0027t download a lot of music and shows, or don\u0027t take many photos and videos, or if you have a lot of unused apps on your phone, then you can probably stick to a storage option similar to what you already have.\r\u003cbr /\u003e\r\u003cbr /\u003eBut if you love to capture every moment with your camera, spend downtime with graphics-heavy games or use your phone for work — it may be time to upgrade to a higher built-in storage size. Check the available options for your new device and choose the storage variant that\u0027s right for you."}]}